Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain
Return-path: <netdev-owner@vger.kernel.org>
Sender: netdev-owner@vger.kernel.org
To: kyle@kernel.org, jwboyer@kernel.org
Cc: netdev@vger.kernel.org, linux-rdma@vger.kernel.org, linux-scsi@vger.kernel.org, linux-firmware@kernel.org, ben@decadent.org.uk, ariel.elior@cavium.com
List-Id: linux-scsi@vger.kernel.org

This patch add a new qed firmware with fixes and added
support for new features.
-Fix aRFS for tunneled traffic without inner IP.
-Fix chip configuration which may fail under heavy traffic conditions.
-Fix iSCSI recovery flow.
-Support receiving any-VNI in VXLAN and GENEVE RX classification.
-Support additional RoCE statistics for error cases.
-Support RoCE T10DIF.

Signed-off-by: Rahul Verma <rahul.verma@cavium.com>
